@startuml Vista de Processos – Level 2 (US 4.1.11 – Complete VVE)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

participant "<<container (C4)>>\nSPA (Web UI)" as UI #87CEEB
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nOEM (Backend)" as OEM #87CEEB
participant "<<external>>\nIAM" as IAM #F5F5DC

-> UI: 1: request to complete VVE
activate UI
UI -> IAM: 1.1: validate token
activate IAM
IAM --> UI: 1.1.1: token valid
deactivate IAM

UI -> OEM: 1.2: GET /api/vesselvisitexecutions/{id}
activate OEM
OEM --> UI: 1.2.1: VVE details with executed operations
deactivate OEM

UI --> : 1.3: display completion form (unberth/departure times)
deactivate UI

-> UI: 2: provide unberth and departure times
activate UI
UI -> OEM: 2.1: PUT /api/vesselvisitexecutions/{id}/complete
activate OEM

alt All operations completed
    OEM --> UI: 2.1.1: VVE completed successfully
else Pending operations exist
    OEM --> UI: 2.1.2: error - complete all operations first
end
deactivate OEM

UI --> : 2.2: display result
deactivate UI

@enduml
